select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_CONDITIONAL_MAIN_CLAUSE_SUBJECT_AND_PREDICATE', '文法規則：CLAUSE CONDITIONAL MAIN_CLAUSE SUBJECT_AND_PREDICATE', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.CONDITIONAL.MAIN_CLAUSE.SUBJECT_AND_PREDICATE', '["clause","conditional","main_clause","subject_and_predicate"]'::jsonb, 'keep to change every year', 'they need to change their uniforms every year', 'if 從句後面需要完整主句。原句缺少主語，也沒有說明甚麼需要更換。目標句按上下文補成 they need to change their uniforms。也可能改為被動式 their uniforms need to be changed，因此需老師確認原意。', '["they need to change their uniforms every year"]'::jsonb, '["keep to change every year"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
