select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_COPULAR_ADVANTAGE_IS_THAT', '文法規則：CLAUSE COPULAR ADVANTAGE IS_THAT', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.COPULAR.ADVANTAGE.IS_THAT', '["clause","copular","advantage","is_that"]'::jsonb, 'One major advantage', 'One major advantage is that', 'One major advantage 只是一個名詞詞組，仍欠謂語。用 is that + 完整分句說明該優點的內容。公式：The advantage is that + 主語 + 動詞。', '["One major advantage is that"]'::jsonb, '["One major advantage"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
