select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_COPULAR_FOR_NP_TO_INFINITIVE', '文法規則：CLAUSE COPULAR FOR_NP_TO_INFINITIVE', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.COPULAR.FOR_NP_TO_INFINITIVE', '["clause","copular","for_np_to_infinitive"]'::jsonb, 'solution is the government to limit', 'solution is for the government to limit', '在 be 後用不定詞分句並明確指出執行者時，使用 for + 人／機構 + to + 動詞。公式： The solution is for X to do Y.', '["solution is for the government to limit"]'::jsonb, '["solution is the government to limit"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
