select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_FRONTED_IF_MAIN_CLAUSE_SUBJECT', '文法規則：CLAUSE FRONTED_IF MAIN_CLAUSE_SUBJECT', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.FRONTED_IF.MAIN_CLAUSE_SUBJECT', '["clause","fronted_if","main_clause_subject"]'::jsonb, 'boundaries', 'boundaries, these measures', '句首 If... 部分是條件分句，之後仍需要一個完整主句。原文只有 can protect，欠缺主語；目標句加入 these measures，並以逗號分隔條件分句。', '["boundaries, these measures"]'::jsonb, '["boundaries"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
