select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_FUSED_RELATIVE_NO_RESUMPTIVE_PRONOUN', '文法規則：CLAUSE FUSED_RELATIVE NO_RESUMPTIVE_PRONOUN', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.FUSED_RELATIVE.NO_RESUMPTIVE_PRONOUN', '["clause","fused_relative","no_resumptive_pronoun"]'::jsonb, 'What it concerned', 'What concerned', 'What concerned residents most 是融合關係分句；what 已同時表示「那件事」並在分句中擔任主語，因此不能再加入 it。', '["What concerned"]'::jsonb, '["What it concerned"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
