select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_HOWEVER_ADJECTIVE_CONCESSIVE_ORDER', '文法規則：CLAUSE HOWEVER ADJECTIVE CONCESSIVE_ORDER', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.HOWEVER.ADJECTIVE.CONCESSIVE_ORDER', '["clause","however","adjective","concessive_order"]'::jsonb, 'However the repairs complicated may become', 'However complicated the repairs may become', 'however 表示「無論多麼」時，形容詞要立即放在 however 後面。公式： however + 形容詞 + 主語 + may／might + 動詞。亦可寫 No matter how complicate d…。', '["However complicated the repairs may become"]'::jsonb, '["However the repairs complicated may become"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
