select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_INDIRECT_YES_NO_WHETHER_STATEMENT_ORDER', '文法規則：CLAUSE INDIRECT_YES_NO WHETHER_STATEMENT_ORDER', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.INDIRECT_YES_NO.WHETHER_STATEMENT_ORDER', '["clause","indirect_yes_no","whether_statement_order"]'::jsonb, 'asked did the survey represented', 'asked whether the survey had represented', 'ask 後面的間接是非問句由 whether／if 引出，並使用陳述句語序。調查代表各群體發生在會議前，因此目標使用過去完成式。', '["asked whether the survey had represented"]'::jsonb, '["asked did the survey represented"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
