select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_MAIN_SUBJECT_NO_RESUMPTIVE_PRONOUN', '文法規則：CLAUSE MAIN_SUBJECT NO_RESUMPTIVE_PRONOUN', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.MAIN_SUBJECT.NO_RESUMPTIVE_PRONOUN', '["clause","main_subject","no_resumptive_pronoun"]'::jsonb, 'our private time it has', 'our private time has', 'our private time 已經是主句主語，不能再加入代名詞 it 重複同一主語。公式：主語 + 有限動詞，不是主語 + it + 有限動詞。', '["our private time has"]'::jsonb, '["our private time it has"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
