select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_MISSING_COPULA_ADJECTIVE_COMPLEMENT', '文法規則：CLAUSE MISSING_COPULA ADJECTIVE_COMPLEMENT', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.MISSING_COPULA.ADJECTIVE_COMPLEMENT', '["clause","missing_copula","adjective_complement"]'::jsonb, 'uniform quality', 'they are', 'not warm 是形容詞補語，前面需要主語和連繫動詞 be。目標句以 they 指回 uniforms：they are not warm。若原意是品質差，可另寫 the material is not warm enough。', '["they are"]'::jsonb, '["uniform quality"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
