select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_MUCH_AS_CONCESSIVE', '文法規則：CLAUSE MUCH_AS CONCESSIVE', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.MUCH_AS.CONCESSIVE', '["clause","much_as","concessive"]'::jsonb, 'Much although', 'Much as', 'Much as + 主語 + 動詞可表示「雖然」。不能把 much 和 although 直接組合。另一個正確寫法是 Although the mayor wanted…。', '["Much as"]'::jsonb, '["Much although"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
