select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_NONRESTRICTIVE_WHICH_NO_COORDINATING_AND', '文法規則：CLAUSE NONRESTRICTIVE_WHICH NO_COORDINATING_AND', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.NONRESTRICTIVE_WHICH.NO_COORDINATING_AND', '["clause","nonrestrictive_which","no_coordinating_and"]'::jsonb, ', and which', ', which', 'which may boost... 是補充前面整個結果的非限制性關係分句。前面已有逗號連接，因此不再加入 and。 另一個正確寫法是分成兩個主句：..., and this may boost their anxiety.', '[", which"]'::jsonb, '[", and which"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
