select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_PREPOSITION_WHETHER_NOT_IF', '文法規則：CLAUSE PREPOSITION WHETHER NOT_IF', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.PREPOSITION.WHETHER.NOT_IF', '["clause","preposition","whether","not_if"]'::jsonb, 'depends on if', 'depends on whether', '疑問分句直接放在介詞 on 後面時，標準寫法使用 whether。if 一般不能直接跟在介詞後。', '["depends on whether"]'::jsonb, '["depends on if"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
