select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_RARELY_INITIAL_PAST_PERFECT_INVERSION', '文法規則：CLAUSE RARELY INITIAL_PAST_PERFECT_INVERSION', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.RARELY.INITIAL_PAST_PERFECT_INVERSION', '["clause","rarely","initial_past_perfect_inversion"]'::jsonb, 'Rarely the museum had received', 'Rarely had the museum received', 'Rarely 等具否定或限制意思的副詞放在句首時，要把助動詞放到主語前。這裡原本是過去完成式，所以寫 Rarely had the museum received...。', '["Rarely had the museum received"]'::jsonb, '["Rarely the museum had received"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
