select '2026-08-02.1', 'CLAUSE_REASON_WHY_IS_THAT', '文法規則：CLAUSE REASON_WHY IS_THAT', 'sentence_structure', 'CLAUSE.REASON_WHY.IS_THAT', '["clause","reason_why","is_that"]'::jsonb, 'is because', 'is that', '正式標準結構是 The reason why... is that + 分句。because 本身表示原因，在 reason is because 中形成重複。非正式英文偶爾可見原寫法，因此新規則宜先設為 suggestion-only。', '["is that"]'::jsonb, '["is because"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
