select '2026-08-02.1', 'COLLOC_ACCOUNT_FOR_PERCENTAGE', '文法規則：COLLOC ACCOUNT_FOR PERCENTAGE', 'preposition', 'COLLOC.ACCOUNT_FOR.PERCENTAGE', '["colloc","account_for","percentage"]'::jsonb, 'is almost one-half, got 50.1%', 'accounted for 50.1% of the population', '圖表寫作中，表示某組別佔整體某個百分比，可用 account for + 百分比 + of the total/population。 2000 年是過去數據，所以用 accounted for。 got 50.1% 不適合描述人口比例。', '["accounted for 50.1% of the population"]'::jsonb, '["is almost one-half, got 50.1%"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
