select '2026-08-02.1', 'COLLOC_HAVE_EFFECTS_ON', '文法規則：COLLOC HAVE_EFFECTS ON', 'preposition', 'COLLOC.HAVE_EFFECTS.ON', '["colloc","have_effects","on"]'::jsonb, 'has placed detrimental effects on', 'has had detrimental effects on', '表示某事對某人產生影響，可用 have an effect on 或 have effects on。 所以這裡寫 has had detrimental effects on workers。另一個正確結構是 has placed considerablepressure on workers，但不能混合兩個搭配。', '["has had detrimental effects on","has negative effects on"]'::jsonb, '["has placed detrimental effects on","draws on negative effects to"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
