select '2026-08-02.1', 'COLLOC_HAVE_TIME_TO_SLEEP', '文法規則：COLLOC HAVE_TIME TO_SLEEP', 'preposition', 'COLLOC.HAVE_TIME.TO_SLEEP', '["colloc","have_time","to_sleep"]'::jsonb, 'homework and get quality', 'homework, have more', 'quality time 通常指有意義地與某人相處或從事重視的活動，不等於可供睡眠的時間。若原意是「多一點時間睡覺」，可寫 have more time to sleep；若強調睡眠量，可寫 get enough sleep。', '["homework, have more"]'::jsonb, '["homework and get quality"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
