select '2026-08-02.1', 'CONDITIONAL_INVERTED_HAD_NO_IF', '文法規則：CONDITIONAL INVERTED_HAD NO_IF', 'sentence_structure', 'CONDITIONAL.INVERTED_HAD.NO_IF', '["conditional","inverted_had","no_if"]'::jsonb, 'If had the council acted', 'Had the council acted', '第三條件句可省略 if， 並把 had 放到主語前：Had the council acted…。 不能同時保留 if 和倒裝。另一個正確寫法是 If the council had acted…。', '["Had the council acted"]'::jsonb, '["If had the council acted"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
