select '2026-08-02.1', 'CONDITIONAL_INVERTED_SHOULD_BASE_VERB', '文法規則：CONDITIONAL INVERTED_SHOULD BASE_VERB', 'sentence_structure', 'CONDITIONAL.INVERTED_SHOULD.BASE_VERB', '["conditional","inverted_should","base_verb"]'::jsonb, 'Should any donor will object', 'Should any donor object', 'Should + 主語 + 動詞原形是正式的倒裝條件句，相當於 If any donor should object。 should 後面不能再加入 will。', '["Should any donor object"]'::jsonb, '["Should any donor will object"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
