select '2026-08-02.1', 'CONDITIONAL_INVERTED_WERE_WOULD', '文法規則：CONDITIONAL INVERTED_WERE WOULD', 'sentence_structure', 'CONDITIONAL.INVERTED_WERE.WOULD', '["conditional","inverted_were","would"]'::jsonb, 'Were it not for donations, the archive will close', 'Were it not for donations, the archive would close', 'Were it not for... 相當於 If it were not for...，是現在或未來的反事實條件，因此結果部分用 would + 動詞原形。', '["Were it not for donations, the archive would close"]'::jsonb, '["Were it not for donations, the archive will close"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
