select '2026-08-02.1', 'DEGREE_MUCH_TOO_ADJECTIVE', '文法規則：DEGREE MUCH_TOO ADJECTIVE', 'comparison', 'DEGREE.MUCH_TOO.ADJECTIVE', '["degree","much_too","adjective"]'::jsonb, 'too much expensive', 'much too expensive', 'too 修飾形容詞 expensive； much 再加強 too，所以詞序是 much too + 形容詞。too much 則通常修飾不可數名詞，例如 too much money。', '["much too expensive"]'::jsonb, '["too much expensive"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
