select '2026-08-02.1', 'DEGREE_SO_ADJECTIVE_THAT', '文法規則：DEGREE SO_ADJECTIVE THAT', 'comparison', 'DEGREE.SO_ADJECTIVE.THAT', '["degree","so_adjective","that"]'::jsonb, 'such practical that', 'so practical that', 'practical 是沒有名詞跟隨的形容詞，所以使用 so practical that。公式：so + 形容詞／副詞 + that。對照：such a practical demonstration that，其中 such 後面有名詞詞組。', '["so practical that"]'::jsonb, '["such practical that"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
