select '2026-08-02.1', 'DETERMINER_ANY_IN_NEGATIVE_CLAUSE', '文法規則：DETERMINER ANY IN_NEGATIVE_CLAUSE', 'article_or_determiner', 'DETERMINER.ANY.IN_NEGATIVE_CLAUSE', '["determiner","any","in_negative_clause"]'::jsonb, 'did not have some cash', 'did not have any cash', '一般否定句通常用 any：not have any cash。 some 可出現在預期肯定答案的問句、提議或強調語境中。', '["did not have any cash"]'::jsonb, '["did not have some cash"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
