select '2026-08-02.1', 'DETERMINER_POSSESSIVE_REQUIRES_NOUN', '文法規則：DETERMINER POSSESSIVE REQUIRES_NOUN', 'article_or_determiner', 'DETERMINER.POSSESSIVE.REQUIRES_NOUN', '["determiner","possessive","requires_noun"]'::jsonb, 'what their think', 'what their friends think', 'their 是所有格限定詞，後面必須有名詞。根據前面的 friendships，目標句補上 friends。也可寫 what others think。 由於所指人物需靠上文推斷，建議老師確認。', '["what their friends think"]'::jsonb, '["what their think"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
