select '2026-08-02.1', 'MODAL_NEEDNT_HAVE_PAST_PARTICIPLE', '文法規則：MODAL NEEDNT_HAVE PAST_PARTICIPLE', 'modal_or_auxiliary', 'MODAL.NEEDNT_HAVE.PAST_PARTICIPLE', '["modal","neednt_have","past_participle"]'::jsonb, 'needn''t stayed', 'needn''t have stayed', '表示某人實際做了某件事，但事後發現沒有必要，用 needn''t have + 過去分詞。 didn''t need to stay 可能表示根本沒有留下，意思不同。', '["needn''t have stayed"]'::jsonb, '["needn''t stayed"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
