select '2026-08-02.1', 'MODAL_PERFECT_PASSIVE_HAVE_BEEN_PARTICIPLE', '文法規則：MODAL PERFECT_PASSIVE HAVE_BEEN_PARTICIPLE', 'modal_or_auxiliary', 'MODAL.PERFECT_PASSIVE.HAVE_BEEN_PARTICIPLE', '["modal","perfect_passive","have_been_participle"]'::jsonb, 'might have avoided', 'might have been avoided', 'treatment 是「本來可能被避免」的事物，所以用完成式被動語態：might have been + 過去分詞。 The hospital might have avoided the expense 才是主動結構。', '["might have been avoided"]'::jsonb, '["might have avoided"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
