select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARALLEL_CHART_ACTUAL_AND_PROJECTED_DISTRIBUTIONS', '文法規則：PARALLEL CHART ACTUAL_AND_PROJECTED_DISTRIBUTIONS', 'parallelism', 'PARALLEL.CHART.ACTUAL_AND_PROJECTED_DISTRIBUTIONS', '["parallel","chart","actual_and_projected_distributions"]'::jsonb, 'and projections for 2050', 'and the projected distributions for 2050', '前面描述的是 2000 年的年齡分布，後面亦應使用平行名詞詞組表示 2050 年的預測分布。 projected 是形容詞，修飾 distributions。若圖表實際展示其他預測數據，中心名詞須按原圖調整。', '["and the projected distributions for 2050"]'::jsonb, '["and projections for 2050"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
where exists (select 1 from public.writing_grammar_corpus_releases where corpus_version = '2026-08-02.1' and status = 'reviewed') on conflict do nothing;
