select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARALLEL_COORDINATED_NOUN_PHRASES_REPEATED_HEAD', '文法規則：PARALLEL COORDINATED_NOUN_PHRASES REPEATED_HEAD', 'parallelism', 'PARALLEL.COORDINATED_NOUN_PHRASES.REPEATED_HEAD', '["parallel","coordinated_noun_phrases","repeated_head"]'::jsonb, 'more personal and more rest time', 'more personal time and more rest time', 'personal 是形容詞，不能單獨作 have 的受詞。加入名詞 time 後，兩部分成為平行名詞詞組：more personal time 和 more rest time。', '["more personal time and more rest time"]'::jsonb, '["more personal and more rest time"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
