select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARALLEL_PAST_TENSE_COORDINATED', '文法規則：PARALLEL PAST_TENSE COORDINATED', 'parallelism', 'PARALLEL.PAST_TENSE.COORDINATED', '["parallel","past_tense","coordinated"]'::jsonb, 'refund', 'refunded', 'apologised、sent 和 refunded 是三個並列的過去式動作，所以 refund 要改為 refunded。', '["refunded"]'::jsonb, '["refund"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
