select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARALLEL_RESULT_PROTECT_AND_HELP', '文法規則：PARALLEL RESULT PROTECT_AND_HELP', 'parallelism', 'PARALLEL.RESULT.PROTECT_AND_HELP', '["parallel","result","protect_and_help"]'::jsonb, 'to keep', 'can help them maintain', '前一部分表示「保護工人免受工作和壓力」，後一部分則表示「幫助他們維持關係」。兩個結果需要各自完整的動詞結構：can protect... and can help them maintain...。', '["can help them maintain"]'::jsonb, '["to keep"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
