select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARALLEL_SHARED_REDUCE_COORDINATED_OBJECTS', '文法規則：PARALLEL SHARED_REDUCE COORDINATED_OBJECTS', 'parallelism', 'PARALLEL.SHARED_REDUCE.COORDINATED_OBJECTS', '["parallel","shared_reduce","coordinated_objects"]'::jsonb, 'and it can less wear and tear', 'and wear and tear', 'reduce 同時控制兩個賓語： expenses 和 wear and tear。 less 是比較限定詞或形容詞，不能在這裡直接充當動詞。公式： reduce A and B。', '["and wear and tear"]'::jsonb, '["and it can less wear and tear"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
