select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARALLEL_TRANSITIVE_VERBS_EXPLICIT_OBJECT', '文法規則：PARALLEL TRANSITIVE_VERBS EXPLICIT_OBJECT', 'parallelism', 'PARALLEL.TRANSITIVE_VERBS.EXPLICIT_OBJECT', '["parallel","transitive_verbs","explicit_object"]'::jsonb, 'punish or give them bad reviews', 'punish them or give them bad reviews', 'punish 是及物動詞，需要受詞。後面的 them 是 give 的間接受詞，不能自動倒推為 punish 的受詞，因此要明確寫 punish them。', '["punish them or give them bad reviews"]'::jsonb, '["punish or give them bad reviews"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
