select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARTICIPLE_MALFORMED_MODIFIER_POSSESSIVE_RECONSTRUCTION', '文法規則：PARTICIPLE MALFORMED_MODIFIER POSSESSIVE_RECONSTRUCTION', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'PARTICIPLE.MALFORMED_MODIFIER.POSSESSIVE_RECONSTRUCTION', '["participle","malformed_modifier","possessive_reconstruction"]'::jsonb, 'the student finishing the PE leasson T-shirt', 'after a student finishes a PE lesson, their T-shirt', '原詞序不能清楚顯示誰完成體育課、哪件 T-shirt 屬於誰。目標句先用時間分句 after a student finish es...， 再用所有格 their T-shirt。 leasson 同時改為 lesson。', '["after a student finishes a PE lesson, their T-shirt"]'::jsonb, '["the student finishing the PE leasson T-shirt"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
