select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARTICIPLE_PERFECT_MATCHED_SUBJECT', '文法規則：PARTICIPLE PERFECT MATCHED_SUBJECT', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'PARTICIPLE.PERFECT.MATCHED_SUBJECT', '["participle","perfect","matched_subject"]'::jsonb, 'Having reviewed the evidence, the conclusion was', 'Having reviewed the evidence, the panel concluded', 'Having reviewed the evidence 的隱含執行者必須是主句主語。能夠「審閱證據」的是 panel，不是 conclusion。邊界： Having been reviewed, the evidence was archived 是正確被動結構，因為 evidence 是被審閱的事物。', '["Having reviewed the evidence, the panel concluded"]'::jsonb, '["Having reviewed the evidence, the conclusion was"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
