select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARTICIPLE_SUPPLEMENTARY_SHRINKING', '文法規則：PARTICIPLE SUPPLEMENTARY SHRINKING', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'PARTICIPLE.SUPPLEMENTARY.SHRINKING', '["participle","supplementary","shrinking"]'::jsonb, 'just shrink', 'shrinking only', '逗號後面的部分補充說明「保持相對穩定」的具體變化，可用現在分詞 shrinking。 only slightly 修飾縮減程度。另一個正確寫法是 and is expected to shrink only slightly。', '["shrinking only"]'::jsonb, '["just shrink"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
