select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_AFTER_PREPOSITION_OBJECT_CASE', '文法規則：PRONOUN AFTER_PREPOSITION OBJECT_CASE', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.AFTER_PREPOSITION.OBJECT_CASE', '["pronoun","after_preposition","object_case"]'::jsonb, 'Between my neighbour and I', 'Between my neighbour and me', 'between 是介詞，後面的代名詞使用賓格 me，不用主格 I。公式：介詞 + 賓格代名詞。對照： My neighbour and I carried the tools，其中整個詞組是主語。', '["Between my neighbour and me"]'::jsonb, '["Between my neighbour and I"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
