select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_AMBIGUOUS_THEY_EXPLICIT_STAFF', '文法規則：PRONOUN AMBIGUOUS_THEY EXPLICIT_STAFF', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.AMBIGUOUS_THEY.EXPLICIT_STAFF', '["pronoun","ambiguous_they","explicit_staff"]'::jsonb, 'they', 'the staff', '前面同時出現 passengers 和 staff，they 可能指任何一方或兩方。由於穿制服的是員工，應明確寫 the staff。 若上下文另有所指，系統應保留原句並要求確認。', '["the staff"]'::jsonb, '["they"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
