select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_AMBIGUOUS_THEY_EXPLICIT_WORKERS', '文法規則：PRONOUN AMBIGUOUS_THEY EXPLICIT_WORKERS', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.AMBIGUOUS_THEY.EXPLICIT_WORKERS', '["pronoun","ambiguous_they","explicit_workers"]'::jsonb, 'as they have no obligation', 'as workers have no obligation', 'they 前面同時出現 employers 和 workers， 讀者不能安全確定所指對象。根據文章立場，應是 workers 沒有義務隨時工作，因此用明確名詞。', '["as workers have no obligation"]'::jsonb, '["as they have no obligation"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
