select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_DOUBLE_GENITIVE_OF_MINE', '文法規則：PRONOUN DOUBLE_GENITIVE OF_MINE', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.DOUBLE_GENITIVE.OF_MINE', '["pronoun","double_genitive","of_mine"]'::jsonb, 'colleague of me', 'colleague of mine', 'a colleague of... 後面使用獨立所有格代名詞 mine，形成雙重所有格。也可寫 my colleague， 但兩者在語境上可能略有差別。', '["colleague of mine"]'::jsonb, '["colleague of me"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
