select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_POSSESSIVE_CUSTOMER_STAFF_NONPOSSESSION', '文法規則：PRONOUN POSSESSIVE CUSTOMER_STAFF NONPOSSESSION', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.POSSESSIVE.CUSTOMER_STAFF.NONPOSSESSION', '["pronoun","possessive","customer_staff","nonpossession"]'::jsonb, 'their staff', 'staff', 'their 最自然會指向主語 customers，形成「顧客所擁有的員工」，不符合上下文。若意思是顧客辨認店內員工，直接寫 locate staff。 若指某公司的員工，可寫 locate the company ''s staff。', '["staff"]'::jsonb, '["their staff"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
