select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_POSSESSIVE_DETERMINER_THEIR', '文法規則：PRONOUN POSSESSIVE_DETERMINER THEIR', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.POSSESSIVE_DETERMINER.THEIR', '["pronoun","possessive_determiner","their"]'::jsonb, 'theirs bosses', 'their bosses', '名詞 bosses 前需要所有格限定詞 their。 theirs 是獨立所有格代名詞，後面不能再接名詞，例如 The decision is their s.', '["their bosses"]'::jsonb, '["theirs bosses"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
