select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_REFLEXIVE_NOT_COORDINATED_SUBJECT', '文法規則：PRONOUN REFLEXIVE NOT_COORDINATED_SUBJECT', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.REFLEXIVE.NOT_COORDINATED_SUBJECT', '["pronoun","reflexive","not_coordinated_subject"]'::jsonb, 'Myself and the curator disagreed', 'The curator and I disagreed', '反身代名詞 myself 不能只為了顯得正式而代替主格 I。整個並列詞組是主語，所以用 the curator and I。', '["The curator and I disagreed"]'::jsonb, '["Myself and the curator disagreed"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
