select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_REFLEXIVE_REQUIRES_COREFERENCE', '文法規則：PRONOUN REFLEXIVE REQUIRES_COREFERENCE', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.REFLEXIVE.REQUIRES_COREFERENCE', '["pronoun","reflexive","requires_coreference"]'::jsonb, 'the chair asked myself', 'the chair asked me', '反身代名詞要與同一分句的主語指向同一人，例如 I asked myself。這裡主語是 the chair，受詞是作者，所以用 me。', '["the chair asked me"]'::jsonb, '["the chair asked myself"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
