select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_RELATIVE_HUMAN_NONRESTRICTIVE_WHO', '文法規則：PRONOUN RELATIVE HUMAN_NONRESTRICTIVE WHO', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.RELATIVE.HUMAN_NONRESTRICTIVE.WHO', '["pronoun","relative","human_nonrestrictive","who"]'::jsonb, 'which', 'who', '先行詞 families 指人，所以非限制性關係分句使用 who。which 通常指事物；逗號後也不使用限制性關係代名詞 that。', '["who"]'::jsonb, '["which"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
