select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_RELATIVE_WHOSE_POSSESSIVE', '文法規則：PRONOUN RELATIVE WHOSE POSSESSIVE', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.RELATIVE.WHOSE.POSSESSIVE', '["pronoun","relative","whose","possessive"]'::jsonb, 'who''s bicycle', 'whose bicycle', 'whose 表示「誰的」，在這裡修飾 bicycle。 who''s 是 who is 或 who has 的縮寫。正確對照：Who''s ready? = Who is ready?', '["whose bicycle","students whose journeys"]'::jsonb, '["who''s bicycle","students which journeys"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
