select '2026-08-02.1', 'PRONOUN_THIS_CLAUSAL_REFERENCE', '文法規則：PRONOUN THIS CLAUSAL_REFERENCE', 'pronoun', 'PRONOUN.THIS.CLAUSAL_REFERENCE', '["pronoun","this","clausal_reference"]'::jsonb, 'it', 'this', 'it 容易被理解為指最近的 shop 或 staff。本句實際指「能迅速找到員工」這個整體情況，因此用 this 指回上一個分句。更明確的寫法是 this ease of identification will increase...。', '["this"]'::jsonb, '["it"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
