select '2026-08-02.1', 'PUNCT_INTRODUCTORY_LINKER_COMMA', '文法規則：PUNCT INTRODUCTORY_LINKER COMMA', 'punctuation', 'PUNCT.INTRODUCTORY_LINKER.COMMA', '["punct","introductory_linker","comma"]'::jsonb, 'As a result', 'As a result,', 'As a result 是句首連接語，後面通常加逗號。後面的 but mentally still... 是省略了重複主語和助動詞的平行結構，本身可以成立。', '["As a result,","Also,","At the same time,"]'::jsonb, '["As a result","Also","At the same time"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
