select '2026-08-02.1', 'PUNCT_INTRODUCTORY_PREPOSITIONAL_PHRASE_COMMA', '文法規則：PUNCT INTRODUCTORY_PREPOSITIONAL_PHRASE COMMA', 'punctuation', 'PUNCT.INTRODUCTORY_PREPOSITIONAL_PHRASE.COMMA', '["punct","introductory_prepositional_phrase","comma"]'::jsonb, 'after work', 'after work,', 'after work 位於主句前作時間狀語，加入逗號可清楚標示主句從 people 開始。短狀語的逗號有時可省略，但本句結構複雜，應保留。', '["after work,"]'::jsonb, '["after work"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
