select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_AGREE_THAT_FINITE_CLAUSE', '文法規則：VERB AGREE THAT_FINITE_CLAUSE', 'other_grammar', 'VERB.AGREE.THAT_FINITE_CLAUSE', '["verb","agree","that_finite_clause"]'::jsonb, 'agree with preventing illness is', 'agree that preventing illness is', 'agree 接完整內容分句時，用 agree that + 主語 + 動詞。agree with 通常接人、意見或名詞詞組，例如 agree with the proposal；不能在 with 後直接接 preventing illness is... 這類完整分句。', '["agree that preventing illness is"]'::jsonb, '["agree with preventing illness is"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
