select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_BLAME_RESULT_ON_CAUSE', '文法規則：VERB BLAME RESULT_ON_CAUSE', 'other_grammar', 'VERB.BLAME.RESULT_ON_CAUSE', '["verb","blame","result_on_cause"]'::jsonb, 'blamed the delay for a cancelled train', 'blamed the delay on a cancelled train', 'blame + 結果 + on + 原因：把延誤歸咎於火車取消。另一個正確結構是 blame the cancelled train for the delay。 兩個賓語角色不可倒轉。', '["blamed the delay on a cancelled train"]'::jsonb, '["blamed the delay for a cancelled train"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
