select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_MEAN_GERUND_ENTAIL', '文法規則：VERB MEAN GERUND ENTAIL', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'VERB.MEAN.GERUND.ENTAIL', '["verb","mean","gerund","entail"]'::jsonb, 'meant to complete', 'meant completing', 'mean doing 表示某件事必然涉及另一件事。更換卡片會涉及填寫另一張表格。 mean to do 則表示有意打算做某事。', '["meant completing"]'::jsonb, '["meant to complete"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
