select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_MEAN_TO_INFINITIVE_INTENTION', '文法規則：VERB MEAN TO_INFINITIVE INTENTION', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'VERB.MEAN.TO_INFINITIVE.INTENTION', '["verb","mean","to_infinitive","intention"]'::jsonb, 'did not mean delaying', 'did not mean to delay', '表示沒有打算延誤小組，用 mean to + 動詞原形。mean delaying 會表示某情況意味著延誤。', '["did not mean to delay"]'::jsonb, '["did not mean delaying"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
