select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_REMEMBER_GERUND_PAST_MEMORY', '文法規則：VERB REMEMBER GERUND PAST_MEMORY', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'VERB.REMEMBER.GERUND.PAST_MEMORY', '["verb","remember","gerund","past_memory"]'::jsonb, 'remembered to leave', 'remembered leaving', 'remember doing 表示記得曾經做過某事。 remember to do 表示記得要做某事並執行。原意是她回想自己把卡留在巴士上，因此用動名詞。', '["remembered leaving"]'::jsonb, '["remembered to leave"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
