select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_REMIND_NP_TO_INFINITIVE', '文法規則：VERB REMIND NP TO_INFINITIVE', 'infinitive_or_gerund', 'VERB.REMIND.NP.TO_INFINITIVE', '["verb","remind","np","to_infinitive"]'::jsonb, 'reminded to write', 'reminded them to write', 'remind 通常要指出提醒的對象。這裡 them 指上一句的 new visitors。 公式： remind + 人 + to + 動詞原形。邊界： remember to write 表示主語自己記得做某事。', '["reminded them to write","reminded students to lock"]'::jsonb, '["reminded to write","reminded students locking"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
