select '2026-08-02.1', 'VERB_WOULD_RATHER_BASE_THAN_BASE', '文法規則：VERB WOULD_RATHER BASE_THAN_BASE', 'other_grammar', 'VERB.WOULD_RATHER.BASE_THAN_BASE', '["verb","would_rather","base_than_base"]'::jsonb, 'would rather to donate unused tools than throwing them away', 'would rather donate unused tools than throw them away', 'would rather 後面用動詞原形； than 後面的平行動作也用動詞原形。這是一組相依修改。公式： would rather + 動詞原形 + than + 動詞原形。邊界： would prefer to donate 中則保留 to。', '["would rather donate unused tools than throw them away"]'::jsonb, '["would rather to donate unused tools than throwing them away"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
