select '2026-08-02.1', 'WORDFORM_LOW_INCOME_ATTRIBUTIVE_HYPHEN', '文法規則：WORDFORM LOW_INCOME ATTRIBUTIVE_HYPHEN', 'word_form', 'WORDFORM.LOW_INCOME.ATTRIBUTIVE_HYPHEN', '["wordform","low_income","attributive_hyphen"]'::jsonb, 'income family this', 'low-income families, this', '表示收入較低的家庭，常用複合形容詞 low-income， 放在名詞前時加連字號。文章泛指多個家庭，因此用 families，並在句首短語後加逗號。 low 是根據「沉重負擔」推斷，需老師確認。', '["low-income families, this"]'::jsonb, '["income family this"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
where exists (select 1 from public.writing_grammar_corpus_releases where corpus_version = '2026-08-02.1' and status = 'reviewed') on conflict do nothing;
