select '2026-08-02.1', 'WORDFORM_VERB_MODIFIED_BY_ADVERB_COMPARATIVE', '文法規則：WORDFORM VERB MODIFIED_BY_ADVERB_COMPARATIVE', 'word_form', 'WORDFORM.VERB.MODIFIED_BY_ADVERB_COMPARATIVE', '["wordform","verb","modified_by_adverb_comparative"]'::jsonb, 'they work become slower and slower', 'they work more and more slowly', 'work 是動作，應由副詞 slowly 修飾。表示動作逐漸變慢，用 more and more slowly。 become slower 可描述人或事物的狀態，但不能直接放在 they work 後形成雙重謂語。', '["they work more and more slowly"]'::jsonb, '["they work become slower and slower"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'British English', 'approved', 'Edmund Sir', 1
