select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0003', 'COMMUNITY_READING_PROGRAMME_0003', 'Community Reading Programme', 'Community / Volunteering', 'A2–B1', 'Last month, I joined an community reading programme at the library. The organiser gave each volunteers a guide and asked us arriving on Saturday mornings. My main duty was to helping children to choose books that was suitable for their age. One boy said he was interested on space, so I showed him a book about planets. The pictures were clear, and he read for twenty minutes. Before leaving, every child returned a name card to the front desk. I enjoyed to work there because the staff were patient and the programme made me more confidence when speaking to strangers.', 'Last month, I joined a community reading programme at the library. The organiser gave each volunteer a guide and asked us to arrive on Saturday mornings. My main duty was to help children to choose books that were suitable for their age. One boy said he was interested in space, so I showed him a book about planets. The pictures were clear, and he read for twenty minutes. Before leaving, every child returned a name card to the front desk. I enjoyed working there because the staff were patient and the programme made me more confident when speaking to strangers.', 100, 100, 7, 8, 'British English', 'Edmund Sir', 'approved', 1, false, false, 'Dataset 3 from the supplied Grammar Dataset 3 to 18 PDF. Approved for canonical storage in the development partition; excluded from live retrieval pending a separate production review.'
