select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0004', 'USING_A_SHOPPING_APP_0004', 'Using a Shopping App', 'Technology / Shopping', 'A2–B1', 'Yesterday, my parents used a shopping app because our fridge were almost empty. The app showed many information and allowed customers compare prices between shops. My mother asked me where could we buy cheaper fruit, but I was not sure. We decided ordering from a supermarket that located near our home. The driver could to deliver the bags before dinner. The payment was made through the app. When the order arrived, two bottle of milk was missing. I contacted with support and discussed about the problem; they quickly apologised, sent the missing items, and refund the fee within an hour.', 'Yesterday, my parents used a shopping app because our fridge was almost empty. The app showed much information and allowed customers to compare prices between shops. My mother asked me where we could buy cheaper fruit, but I was not sure. We decided to order from a supermarket that was located near our home. The driver could deliver the bags before dinner. The payment was made through the app. When the order arrived, two bottles of milk were missing. I contacted support and discussed the problem; they quickly apologised, sent the missing items, and refunded the fee within an hour.', 100, 100, 8, 12, 'British English', 'Edmund Sir', 'approved', 1, false, false, 'Dataset 4 from the supplied Grammar Dataset 3 to 18 PDF. Approved for canonical storage in the development partition; excluded from live retrieval pending a separate production review.'
where exists (select 1 from public.writing_grammar_corpus_releases where corpus_version = '2026-08-02.1' and status = 'reviewed') on conflict do nothing;
