select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0005', 'HIKING_CLUB_PLANS_0005', 'Hiking Club Plans', 'Hobbies / Transport', 'A2–B1', 'Our hiking club is planning a short trip. The list of places are on the noticeboard, but neither route include a climb. The leader said we must to bring water, and she asked each members arrive at the station by eight. She asked, “Where should we meet?” because the station has two exits. There are less buses in the morning, so everyone must arrive on time. A jacket is useful for keeping warm, but if it will rain, the group will visit a museum that located nearby. The equipment are stored there. The staff have agreed to show us around.', 'Our hiking club is planning a short trip. The list of places is on the noticeboard, but neither route includes a climb. The leader said we must bring water, and she asked each member to arrive at the station by eight. She asked, “Where should we meet?” because the station has two exits. There are fewer buses in the morning, so everyone must arrive on time. A jacket is useful for keeping warm, but if it rains, the group will visit a museum that is located nearby. The equipment is stored there. The staff have agreed to show us around.', 100, 100, 8, 9, 'British English', 'Edmund Sir', 'approved', 1, false, false, 'Dataset 5 from the supplied Grammar Dataset 3 to 18 PDF. Approved for canonical storage in the development partition; excluded from live retrieval pending a separate production review.'
where exists (select 1 from public.writing_grammar_corpus_releases where corpus_version = '2026-08-02.1' and status = 'reviewed') on conflict do nothing;
