select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0006-I026', 'I026', 'PARA-0006-S15', 1, 'amount of volunteers', 'number of volunteers', 1, 'COUNT_NUMBER_OF_PLURAL_COUNT_NOUN', '「amount of volunteers」在此應改為「number of volunteers」。volunteers 是可數名詞複數，所以表示數量時使用 number of。公式： number of + 複數可數名詞；amount of + 不可數名詞。正確對照：the amount of equipment。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
