select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0006-I028', 'I028', 'PARA-0006-S16', 1, 'already left', 'had already left', 1, 'TENSE_PAST_PERFECT_BY_THE_TIME_EARLIER_EVENT', '「already left」在此應改為「had already left」。關門和最後一位訪客離開都是過去事件，而訪客離開發生得更早，所以用過去完成式 had left。公式：較早的過去事件用 had + 過去分詞。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
