select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I008', 'I008', 'PARA-0007-S03', 2, 'comply to', 'comply with', 1, 'PREP_COMPLY_WITH_REQUIREMENT', '「comply to」在此應改為「comply with」。comply 的固定搭配是 comply with + 規則／法律／要求，所以寫 comply with the safety code。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
