select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I025', 'I025', 'PARA-0007-S09', 1, 'If had the council acted', 'Had the council acted', 1, 'CONDITIONAL_INVERTED_HAD_NO_IF', '「If had the council acted」在此應改為「Had the council acted」。第三條件句可省略 if， 並把 had 放到主語前：Had the council acted…。 不能同時保留 if 和倒裝。另一個正確寫法是 If the council had acted…。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
