select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I028', 'I028', 'PARA-0007-S10', 2, 'live up with', 'live up to', 1, 'PHRASAL_LIVE_UP_TO_PROMISE', '「live up with」在此應改為「live up to」。live up to 表示達到期望、標準或履行承諾，所以寫 live up to its promises。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
