select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I029', 'I029', 'PARA-0007-S11', 1, 'would rather the council publishes', 'would rather the council published', 1, 'MOOD_WOULD_RATHER_DIFFERENT_SUBJECT_PAST', '「would rather the council publishes」在此應改為「would rather the council published」。would rather 後面若有另一個主語，對現在或將來的期望通常用過去式： would rather + 人／機構 + 過去式。邊界：同一主語時用動詞原形，例如 Residents would rather publish the reports。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
