select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I033', 'I033', 'PARA-0007-S13', 1, 'However the repairs complicated may become', 'However complicated the repairs may become', 1, 'CLAUSE_HOWEVER_ADJECTIVE_CONCESSIVE_ORDER', '「However the repairs complicated may become」在此應改為「However complicated the repairs may become」。however 表示「無論多麼」時，形容詞要立即放在 however 後面。公式： however + 形容詞 + 主語 + may／might + 動詞。亦可寫 No matter how complicate d…。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
