select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I034', 'I034', 'PARA-0007-S13', 2, 'deal about', 'deal with', 1, 'PREP_DEAL_WITH_PROBLEM', '「deal about」在此應改為「deal with」。deal with 表示處理問題。deal in 則表示買賣某類貨品，例如 deal in antiques；deal about 不是本句所需搭配。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
