select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I035', 'I035', 'PARA-0007-S14', 1, 'Having reviewed the evidence, the conclusion was', 'Having reviewed the evidence, the panel concluded', 1, 'PARTICIPLE_PERFECT_MATCHED_SUBJECT', '「Having reviewed the evidence, the conclusion was」在此應改為「Having reviewed the evidence, the panel concluded」。Having reviewed the evidence 的隱含執行者必須是主句主語。能夠「審閱證據」的是 panel，不是 conclusion。邊界： Having been reviewed, the evidence was archived 是正確被動結構，因為 evidence 是被審閱的事物。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
