select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I036', 'I036', 'PARA-0007-S15', 1, 'similar failures are the less likely', 'the less likely similar failures are', 1, 'COMP_CORRELATIVE_THE_MORE_THE_LESS', '「similar failures are the less likely」在此應改為「the less likely similar failures are」。表示兩件事按比例變化時，兩個分句都要以 the + 比較級開始。公式：The more…, the less + 形容詞 + 主語 + 動詞。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
