select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0007-I038', 'I038', 'PARA-0007-S16', 2, 'take it as granted', 'take it for granted', 1, 'COLLOC_TAKE_IT_FOR_GRANTED', '「take it as granted」在此應改為「take it for granted」。固定搭配是 take it for granted that…，表示未經思考便假定某事必然成立。邊界：take it as given that… 也是正確搭配，但使用 given，不使用 granted。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
