select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I001', 'I001', 'PARA-0008-S02', 1, 'agree with preventing illness is', 'agree that preventing illness is', 1, 'VERB_AGREE_THAT_FINITE_CLAUSE', '「agree with preventing illness is」在此應改為「agree that preventing illness is」。agree 接完整內容分句時，用 agree that + 主語 + 動詞。agree with 通常接人、意見或名詞詞組，例如 agree with the proposal；不能在 with 後直接接 preventing illness is... 這類完整分句。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
