select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I005', 'I005', 'PARA-0008-S04', 1, 'invest on health education', 'invest in health education', 1, 'PREP_INVEST_IN_FIELD', '「invest on health education」在此應改為「invest in health education」。表示把資源投放於某個範疇，用 invest in + 項目／領域。也可寫 invest money in education。本句不用 on。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
