select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I008', 'I008', 'PARA-0008-S05', 1, 'A health system, that only responds after people are already sick, is', 'A health system that only responds after people are already sick is', 1, 'CLAUSE_RELATIVE_RESTRICTIVE_THAT_NO_COMMAS', '「A health system, that only responds after people are already sick, is」在此應改為「A health system that only responds after people are already sick is」。that only responds... 用來界定是哪一類 health system，是限制性關係分句，因此前後不加逗號。非限制性補充資料通常用 which 並以逗號分隔，例如 The system, which was introduced last year, is expensiv e.', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
