select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I012', 'I012', 'PARA-0008-S06', 2, 'less likely of developing', 'less likely to develop', 1, 'ADJ_LIKELY_TO_INFINITIVE', '「less likely of developing」在此應改為「less likely to develop」。likely 後面表示可能發生的動作時，用 to + 動詞原形。公式：be likely to do。如果使用名詞 likelihood，則可寫 the likelihood of developing an illness。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
