select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I013', 'I013', 'PARA-0008-S06', 3, 'later at life', 'later in life', 1, 'COLLOC_LATER_IN_LIFE', '「later at life」在此應改為「later in life」。是 later in life，表示在人生較後階段。也可寫 at a later stage in life，但不能直接寫 later at life。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
