select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I018', 'I018', 'PARA-0008-S10', 1, 'damage has done', 'damage has been done', 1, 'TENSE_PRESENT_PERFECT_PASSIVE', '「damage has done」在此應改為「damage has been done」。damage 是被造成的，所以現在完成式要使用被動結構： has been + 過去分詞。主動句需要有施事者，例如 The delay has done serious damage.', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
