select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0008-I027', 'I027', 'PARA-0008-S12', 4, 'whom', 'who', 1, 'PRONOUN_RELATIVE_SUBJECT_WHO_NOT_WHOM', '「whom」在此應改為「who」。關係代名詞在分句中是 can afford 的主語，所以用 who。 whom 用作賓語，例如 the families whom the programme supports。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
