select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0009-I009', 'I009', 'PARA-0009-S04', 2, 'request on urgent projects', 'request work on urgent projects', 1, 'VERB_REQUEST_WORK_DIRECT_OBJECT', '「request on urgent projects」在此應改為「request work on urgent projects」。request 作動詞時需要直接賓語。本句可寫 request work on urgent projects。更清楚的替代寫法是 ask employees to work on urgent projects。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
