select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I012', 'I012', 'PARA-0010-S06', 3, 'as well as students', 'and', 1, 'SHARED_MODAL_PARALLEL', '「as well as students」在此應改為「and」。情態動詞 can 同時控制 reserve、have 和 maintain，所以三個動詞都用原形，亦不重複主語 students。公式： can + verb A, verb B, and verb C。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
