select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I014', 'I014', 'PARA-0010-S07', 2, 'schools environment', 'school environment', 1, 'NOUN_ATTRIBUTIVE_SINGULAR_SCHOOL_ENVIRONMENT', '「schools environment」在此應改為「school environment」。普通名詞放在另一名詞前作修飾語時，通常使用單數，所以是 school environment。複數形式只在少數固定或詞彙化組合中保留。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
