select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I020', 'I020', 'PARA-0010-S08', 6, 'a normal students only have', 'normal students have only', 1, 'ARTICLE_PLURAL_NOUN_NO_A', '「a normal students only have」在此應改為「normal students have only」。a 只能配合單數可數名詞。可寫 a normal student 或 normal students；本句採用複數，與前面的 some affluent students 對照。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
