select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I022', 'I022', 'PARA-0010-S09', 1, 'what their think', 'what their friends think', 1, 'DETERMINER_POSSESSIVE_REQUIRES_NOUN', '「what their think」在此應改為「what their friends think」。their 是所有格限定詞，後面必須有名詞。根據前面的 friendships，目標句補上 friends。也可寫 what others think。 由於所指人物需靠上文推斷，建議老師確認。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
