select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I034', 'I034', 'PARA-0010-S15', 2, 'uniform quality', 'they are', 1, 'CLAUSE_MISSING_COPULA_ADJECTIVE_COMPLEMENT', '「uniform quality」在此應改為「they are」。not warm 是形容詞補語，前面需要主語和連繫動詞 be。目標句以 they 指回 uniforms：they are not warm。若原意是品質差，可另寫 the material is not warm enough。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
