select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I039', 'I039', 'PARA-0010-S16', 4, 'wet and the jacket too thin can''t keep warm', 'wet, and their jacket is too thin to keep them warm', 1, 'ADJ_TOO_TO_CAUSATIVE_KEEP_OBJECT', '「wet and the jacket too thin can''t keep warm」在此應改為「wet, and their jacket is too thin to keep them warm」。第二部分需要完整主句： their jacket is...。 too + 形容詞 + to + 動詞原形表示程度過高而無法達到結果； keep 還需要受詞和形容詞補語：keep them warm。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
