select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I043', 'I043', 'PARA-0010-S19', 1, 'in developmental stage', 'are at a developmental stage', 1, 'CLAUSE_COPULAR_PREPOSITIONAL_STAGE', '「in developmental stage」在此應改為「are at a developmental stage」。students 後面需要有限動詞 are。表示某人處於某一發展階段，可寫 be at a developmental stage； stage 是單數可數名詞，需要 a。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
