select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I046', 'I046', 'PARA-0010-S20', 2, 'become', 'becomes', 1, 'SINGULAR_SUBJECT_VERB', '「become」在此應改為「becomes」。主語是單數指示代名詞 this，所以一般現在式動詞用 becomes。介詞短語 For low-income families 不控制動詞形式。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
