select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0010-I049', 'I049', 'PARA-0010-S22', 1, 'conclusion', 'conclusion,', 1, 'PUNCT_INTRODUCTORY_ADVERBIAL_COMMA', '「conclusion」在此應改為「conclusion,」。In conclusion 是句首引導語，通常在後面加逗號。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
