select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0011-I023', 'I023', 'PARA-0011-S08', 2, 'bus fares and food keep going up', 'rising bus fares and food prices', 1, 'PARALLEL_PRICE_NOUNS_RISING_MODIFIER', '「bus fares and food keep going up」在此應改為「rising bus fares and food prices」。Faced with 後面需要平行的名詞詞組。按上下文，作者似乎指車費和食品價格上升，因此改為 rising bus fares and food prices。因為原文的 food 也可能有其他意思，應由老師確認。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
