select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0011-I024', 'I024', 'PARA-0011-S09', 1, 'their tired bodies to make money', 'their bodies become tired as they work to make money', 1, 'CLAUSE_FRAGMENT_SUBJECT_ADJECTIVE_INFINITIVE_RECONSTRUCTION', '「their tired bodies to make money」在此應改為「their bodies become tired as they work to make money」。原文只有名詞詞組 their tired bodies 和不定詞，沒有有限動詞，因此不是完整句子。目標句加入 become，再以 as 說明身體疲累時正在進行的工作。這是原意推斷，須老師覆核。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
