select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0011-I027', 'I027', 'PARA-0011-S11', 1, 'solution is the government to limit', 'solution is for the government to limit', 1, 'CLAUSE_COPULAR_FOR_NP_TO_INFINITIVE', '「solution is the government to limit」在此應改為「solution is for the government to limit」。在 be 後用不定詞分句並明確指出執行者時，使用 for + 人／機構 + to + 動詞。公式： The solution is for X to do Y.', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
