select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0011-I031', 'I031', 'PARA-0011-S13', 3, 'theirs bosses', 'their bosses', 1, 'PRONOUN_POSSESSIVE_DETERMINER_THEIR', '「theirs bosses」在此應改為「their bosses」。名詞 bosses 前需要所有格限定詞 their。 theirs 是獨立所有格代名詞，後面不能再接名詞，例如 The decision is their s.', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
