select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0011-I035', 'I035', 'PARA-0011-S14', 3, 'more personal and more rest time', 'more personal time and more rest time', 1, 'PARALLEL_COORDINATED_NOUN_PHRASES_REPEATED_HEAD', '「more personal and more rest time」在此應改為「more personal time and more rest time」。personal 是形容詞，不能單獨作 have 的受詞。加入名詞 time 後，兩部分成為平行名詞詞組：more personal time 和 more rest time。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
