select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0011-I043', 'I043', 'PARA-0011-S19', 1, 'However If', 'However, if', 1, 'PUNCT_HOWEVER_COMMA_LOWERCASE_IF', '「However If」在此應改為「However, if」。However 是句首連接副詞，後面加逗號。if 仍在同一句內，因此使用小寫。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
