select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0012-I008', 'I008', 'PARA-0012-S03', 3, 'a work wardrobe expenses', 'expenses for a work wardrobe', 1, 'NOUN_EXPENSES_FOR_WORK_WARDROBE', '「a work wardrobe expenses」在此應改為「expenses for a work wardrobe」。expenses 是複數名詞，前面不能使用單數冠詞 a。表示某項用途所需的開支，可寫 expenses for + 名詞詞組，所以是 expenses for awork wardrobe。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
