select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0012-I009', 'I009', 'PARA-0012-S03', 4, 'and it can less wear and tear', 'and wear and tear', 1, 'PARALLEL_SHARED_REDUCE_COORDINATED_OBJECTS', '「and it can less wear and tear」在此應改為「and wear and tear」。reduce 同時控制兩個賓語： expenses 和 wear and tear。 less 是比較限定詞或形容詞，不能在這裡直接充當動詞。公式： reduce A and B。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
