select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0012-I010', 'I010', 'PARA-0012-S03', 5, 'personal clothes', 'personal clothes.', 1, 'PUNCT_SENTENCE_FINAL_FULL_STOP', '「personal clothes」在此應改為「personal clothes.」。完整陳述句結束時需要句號。段落換行本身不能取代句末標點。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
