select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0012-I020', 'I020', 'PARA-0012-S07', 3, 'with passengers and staff', 'between passengers and staff', 1, 'PREP_COMMUNICATION_BETWEEN_A_AND_B', '「with passengers and staff」在此應改為「between passengers and staff」。表示兩個群體彼此溝通，用 communication between A and B。 communication with passengers 可表示某一方與乘客溝通，但當兩方並列時， between 較準確。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
