select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0012-I024', 'I024', 'PARA-0012-S08', 2, 'is', 'is that', 1, 'CLAUSE_COPULAR_NOUN_THAT_CLAUSE', '「is」在此應改為「is that」。dimension is 後面要接說明其內容的補語。完整有限分句通常由 that 引出：The dimension is that + 主語 + 動詞。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
