select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0012-I032', 'I032', 'PARA-0012-S08', 10, 'if you enter', 'entering', 1, 'VERB_IMAGINE_GERUND', '「if you enter」在此應改為「entering」。imagine 後面可接動名詞，表示想像某個動作或情境： imagine entering a shop。也可寫 imagine that you enter a shop。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
