select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0013-I018', 'I018', 'PARA-0013-S04', 4, '15-59 years old 46.3%', 'the 46.3% recorded for those aged 15–59', 1, 'COMP_FIGURE_FOR_GROUP', '「15-59 years old 46.3%」在此應改為「the 46.3% recorded for those aged 15–59」。higher than 後面需要明確的比較對象。目標句先寫百分比，再用 recorded for those aged 15–59 說明該數字屬於哪個組別。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
