select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0014-I007', 'I007', 'PARA-0014-S05', 2, 'worth to restore', 'worth restoring', 1, 'ADJ_WORTH_GERUND', '「worth to restore」在此應改為「worth restoring」。worth 後面接名詞或動名詞，不接 to 不定詞。公式：be worth + 動名詞。也可寫 It is worthwhile to restore the films.', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
