select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0014-I040', 'I040', 'PARA-0014-S25', 1, 'is because', 'is that', 1, 'CLAUSE_REASON_WHY_IS_THAT', '「is because」在此應改為「is that」。正式標準結構是 The reason why... is that + 分句。because 本身表示原因，在 reason is because 中形成重複。非正式英文偶爾可見原寫法，因此新規則宜先設為 suggestion-only。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
