select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0016-I036', 'I036', 'PARA-0016-S17', 3, 'blamed the delay for a cancelled train', 'blamed the delay on a cancelled train', 1, 'VERB_BLAME_RESULT_ON_CAUSE', '「blamed the delay for a cancelled train」在此應改為「blamed the delay on a cancelled train」。blame + 結果 + on + 原因：把延誤歸咎於火車取消。另一個正確結構是 blame the cancelled train for the delay。 兩個賓語角色不可倒轉。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
