select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0016-I059', 'I059', 'PARA-0016-S29', 1, 'the data was limited', 'the data were limited', 1, 'SVA_DATA_ACADEMIC_PLURAL', '「the data was limited」在此應改為「the data were limited」。正式學術語境可把 data 視為 datum 的複數，因此用 were。 現代一般英文亦常把 data 當集合或不可數名詞並配合 was，不可一律拒絕。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
