select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0017-I003', 'I003', 'PARA-0017-S01', 3, 'from 1995 until 2025', 'between 1995 and 2025', 1, 'PREP_MAP_PERIOD_BETWEEN_AND', '「from 1995 until 2025」在此應改為「between 1995 and 2025」。封閉的兩個時間點可用 between A and B。 from 必須與 to 配對； until 通常表示某狀態持續至某時。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
