select '2026-08-02.1', 'PARA-0017-I007', 'I007', 'PARA-0017-S02', 2, 'lightly-developed', 'lightly developed', 1, 'ORTHOGRAPHY_LY_ADVERB_NO_HYPHEN', '「lightly-developed」在此應改為「lightly developed」。以-ly 結尾的副詞和其後的分詞或形容詞一般不用連字號，例如 lightly developed、densely populated。', '[]'::jsonb, 0.9, 'approved'
